<title>THAILAND: Siam City pays 1.65 baht div for '96.</title>
<headline>Siam City pays 1.65 baht div for '96.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.65    vs    0.75</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Siam City Bank Plc, a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
